     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi again,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m running detection histories but kept getting the following error message:</div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Error\r\nin detectionHistory(recordTable = recordTableUTQ, species = &quot;Rusa\r\nunicolor&quot;,  : <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">  object &#39;date.test&#39; not found</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">I have tried to find out what &#39;date&#39;.test&#39; is but to no avail. I used the following code:<br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><br></p><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">detHistUTQ&lt;-detectionHistory(recordTable = recordTableUTQ, #data.frame<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 species =&quot;Rusa unicolor&quot; , <u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 camOp = cam0pUTQ, #camera operability matrix<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 stationCol = &quot;Station&quot;, <u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 speciesCol = &quot;Species&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 recordDateTimeCol = &quot;DateTimeOriginal&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 recordDateTimeFormat = &quot;%d/%m/%Y %H:%M&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 occasionLength = 1, # in days <u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 day1 = &quot;setup&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 includeEffort = TRUE, #Compute trapping effort<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 scaleEffort = TRUE, #<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 occasionStartTime = 00:00,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 datesAsOccasionNames = TRUE,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 timeZone = &quot;Asia/Kuala_Lumpur&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 writecsv = TRUE,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                 outDir = &quot;D:/Spreadsheets&quot; #which dir to save csv file<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                   )</span></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Please advise. Thank you!</span></span></span></p></div></div>"
